# api http test requests for VSCode rest client

### get cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### get cat by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/5

### test put for cat
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### test delete for cat
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### post new cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Cat",
  "birthdate": "2021-09-01",
  "weight": 5,
  "owner": "Jaakko Saukko",
  "image": "https://loremflickr.com/320/240/cat"
}


### get users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### get user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/1

### test put for user
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/1

### test delete for user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/1

### post new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outo",
  "username": "outo",
  "email": "outo@gmail.com",
  "role": "User",
  "password": "###########"
}